    { "type": "link", "title": "Kiali — le graphe du maillage", "url": "https://kiali.urbanlink.fr", "targetBlank": true, "icon": "external link" }
  ],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 90,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Deux plans, deux sources — à lire avant d'interpréter",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Le maillage tourne en **mode ambient**. C'est ce qui décide de ce que cette page peut montrer.\n\n| | qui mesure | ce qu'on obtient |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Au bord** | `istio-ingressgateway` (proxy L7) | HTTP complet : `istio_requests_total`, codes de réponse, latences, drapeaux |\n| **À l'intérieur** | `ztunnel` (L4 seulement) | TCP : connexions, octets, mTLS. **Aucune métrique HTTP** |\n\n⚠️ **Le `backend` ne produit aucune série `istio_requests_total`, et ce n'est pas une panne.** En ambient, seul un proxy L7 (waypoint, ou la passerelle d'entrée) produit des métriques HTTP ; ztunnel n'en fait pas. Le backend n'apparaît donc qu'en L4, dans la section du bas.\n\nL'ancien tableau de bord interrogeait le L7 par workload interne (`destination_workload_namespace != \"istio-system\"`) : il ne pouvait montrer que le frontend, jamais l'API. Obtenir du L7 interne demanderait de déployer un **waypoint proxy** — un chantier distinct, avec son coût en ressources."
      }
    },

    { "id": 100, "type": "row", "title": "Au bord — L7 (istio-ingressgateway)", "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 }, "panels": [] },

    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requêtes entrantes /s",
      "description": "Tout ce qui franchit la passerelle, quel que soit le nom d'hôte. `reporter=\"source\"` : c'est la passerelle qui rapporte, une seule fois par requête.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(istio_requests_total{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\"}[5m]))", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "req/s" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 2, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false } }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx au bord",
      "description": "À croiser avec le taux 5xx du backend (« 01 »). Un écart entre les deux désigne un problème **avant** l'application : passerelle, routage, ou service injoignable.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "(sum(rate(istio_requests_total{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\", response_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(istio_requests_total{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\"}[5m]))", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "5xx" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "decimals": 2, "min": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 0.02 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false } }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latence p95 au bord",
      "description": "Temps mesuré **par la passerelle**, TLS déjà terminé par l'openresty du nœud. Il inclut donc l'application, mais pas le réseau public.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(istio_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\"}[5m])))", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "p95" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 500 }, { "color": "red", "value": 2000 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false } }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Couverture mTLS",
      "description": "Part des connexions que le **destinataire** voit arriver en `mutual_tls`. Le complément (`unknown`) est essentiellement le trafic entrant par la passerelle, qui n'est pas en mode ambient — pas une faille de chiffrement interne.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(istio_tcp_connections_opened_total{connection_security_policy=\"mutual_tls\", reporter=\"destination\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(istio_tcp_connections_opened_total{reporter=\"destination\"}[5m]))", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "mTLS" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 0.8 }, { "color": "green", "value": 0.95 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "value", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false } }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Certificat de charge — temps restant",
      "description": "⚠️ **Ce n'est pas le certificat public `*.urbanlink.fr`** (renouvelé par certbot sur le nœud Proxmox, invisible d'ici). Ce sont les certificats internes d'Istio : durée de vie **24 h**, renouvelés à mi-parcours. Une valeur autour de 12 à 22 h est donc l'état NORMAL. Un seuil à sept jours — le réflexe qu'appelle un certificat public — tirerait en permanence. L'alerte `IstioCertNotRotating` se déclenche sous **1 h**, c'est-à-dire quand la rotation a réellement échoué.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "min(istio_agent_cert_expiry_seconds)", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "restant" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 3600 }, { "color": "green", "value": 7200 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false } }
    },

    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Trafic entrant par service de destination",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (destination_service_name) (rate(istio_requests_total{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{destination_service_name}}" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" } }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Codes de réponse au bord",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (response_code) (rate(istio_requests_total{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{response_code}}" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" } }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "5.*" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "4.*" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "2.*" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "0" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" } }, { "id": "displayName", "value": "0 (aucune réponse)" }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },

    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latence p95 par destination",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, destination_service_name) (rate(istio_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "{{destination_service_name}}" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 500 }, { "color": "red", "value": 2000 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Drapeaux de réponse Envoy (1 h)",
      "description": "**La seule façon de distinguer deux 503 qui n'ont rien à voir.** `-` est le cas normal et n'est pas listé.\n\n`UF` connexion amont impossible · `UH` aucun hôte sain · `UO` circuit ouvert · `NR` aucune route configurée · `URX` limite de reprises · `DC` connexion coupée par le client (normal sur un flux long : SSE, WebSocket).\n\nSans ce panneau, un `UF` — le service derrière ne répond pas — se lit exactement comme un 503 émis par l'application elle-même. `IngressUpstreamFailures` alerte sur les quatre premiers.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (destination_workload, response_flags, response_code) (increase(istio_requests_total{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\", response_flags!=\"-\"}[1h]))", "instant": true, "format": "table" }],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true }, "renameByName": { "destination_workload": "Destination", "response_flags": "Drapeau", "response_code": "Code", "Value": "Requêtes / h" } } },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "fields": {}, "sort": [{ "field": "Requêtes / h", "desc": true }] } }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "left" }, "decimals": 0 },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Drapeau" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-text" } }, { "id": "mappings", "value": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "DC": { "color": "text", "index": 0, "text": "DC — client parti" }, "UF": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "UF — amont injoignable" }, "UH": { "color": "red", "index": 2, "text": "UH — aucun hôte sain" }, "UO": { "color": "red", "index": 3, "text": "UO — circuit ouvert" }, "NR": { "color": "red", "index": 4, "text": "NR — aucune route" }, "URX": { "color": "orange", "index": 5, "text": "URX — reprises épuisées" } } }] }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "footer": { "show": false, "reducer": ["sum"] } }
    },

    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volume échangé au bord",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(istio_request_bytes_sum{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "requêtes (entrant)" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(rate(istio_response_bytes_sum{source_workload=\"istio-ingressgateway\", reporter=\"source\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "réponses (sortant)" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "Bps", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },

    { "id": 200, "type": "row", "title": "À l'intérieur — L4 (ztunnel)", "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 33 }, "panels": [] },

    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connexions TCP ouvertes /s, par destination",
      "description": "Le seul plan où le `backend`, `postgres`, `redis`, `kafka` et `elasticsearch` sont visibles. `reporter=\"destination\"` pour ne compter chaque connexion qu'une fois.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "topk(10, sum by (destination_workload) (rate(istio_tcp_connections_opened_total{reporter=\"destination\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "{{destination_workload}}" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "decimals": 2, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connexions TCP échouées /s",
      "description": "**Vide est le bon état.** Une seule courbe non nulle désigne un service qui refuse la connexion — c'est le signal le plus direct qu'offre le plan L4, et il précède toujours les erreurs applicatives. Alerte `MeshTCPConnectionFailures`.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 34 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum by (destination_workload) (rate(istio_tcp_connections_failed_total{reporter=\"destination\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{destination_workload}}" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 60, "showPoints": "never" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }] }, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Octets TCP par workload",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 34 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "topk(6, sum by (destination_workload) (rate(istio_tcp_received_bytes_total{reporter=\"destination\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "↓ {{destination_workload}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "topk(6, sum by (destination_workload) (rate(istio_tcp_sent_bytes_total{reporter=\"destination\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "↑ {{destination_workload}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "Bps", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5, "showPoints": "never" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": [] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },

    { "id": 300, "type": "row", "title": "Plan de contrôle (istiod)", "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 41 }, "panels": [] },

    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Temps de convergence des proxies",
      "description": "Délai entre un changement de configuration et le moment où tous les proxies l'appliquent. Un temps qui s'allonge signifie que le routage réel diverge de ce qui est déclaré — un `VirtualService` déployé mais pas encore effectif.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 42 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(pilot_proxy_convergence_time_bucket[5m])))", "legendFormat": "p50" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(pilot_proxy_convergence_time_bucket[5m])))", "legendFormat": "p99" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 10 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Proxies connectés à istiod",
      "description": "Chute brutale = des proxies ont perdu le plan de contrôle. Ils continuent de router avec leur **dernière** configuration : rien ne casse tout de suite, et toute modification déployée ensuite est ignorée en silence.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 42 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(pilot_xds)", "legendFormat": "proxies connectés" },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(pilot_virt_services)", "legendFormat": "VirtualServices connus" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["min", "max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Points de terminaison en défaut",
      "description": "`pilot_endpoint_not_ready` : istiod connaît le Service mais aucun pod prêt derrière. `pilot_k8s_endpoints_with_no_pods` : un Endpoints qui référence un pod disparu. Les deux produisent des `UH` dans la table des drapeaux plus haut.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 42 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" }, "expr": "sum(pilot_endpoint_not_ready) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "endpoints non prêts" },
